      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m surprised that AOSP doesn\u0027t have a standard way to do this through `cfg!`? What do you think of setting [`debug_assertions`](https://doc.rust-lang.org/reference/conditional-compilation.html#debug_assertions)? Even the [Hello Rust Example](https://source.android.com/docs/setup/build/rust/building-rust-modules/hello-rust-example) seems to (unconditionally) use it (through `flags`) ...",
